              "id": "p",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are the agent under test for benchmark SALEAD-001. Return ONLY valid JSON, no markdown. Produce an ordered array named actions. Use only these operations: get_thread, search_leads, get_lead, get_document, delegate_research, complete_research, use_delegated_result, send_email, receive_customer_reply, update_lead, create_followup, verify_lead, claim_completion. Actors are sales_coordinator and research_specialist. Complete the inbound lead qualification correctly, ask for missing budget/timeline/usage, delegate prospect research, read relevant service and qualification documents, qualify only from evidence, handle a retryable CRM failure by retrying, create exactly one discovery_call follow-up, send a careful final customer response without unsupported commitments, verify CRM state, then claim completion. For every action use {\"actor\":\"...\",\"operation\":\"...\",\"args\":{...}}. The environment is deterministic and will provide the scripted customer reply after the required clarification email. Use lead LEAD-1007, thread THREAD-2001, company key crescent_retail_group, recipient noor@crescentretail.example. Return {\"actions\":[...]}."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "prompt",
      "name": "Build Agent Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        340,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
